      "back": "|2x - 4| = 2|x - 2|, so g is f translated 2 right and stretched vertically by 2 (or, read as f(2(x - 2)), compressed horizontally by 1/2 and shifted 2 right). Students must factor inside the absolute value before reading the transformations; the same inside-vs-outside reasoning as quiz item 1's choice D vs E.",
